  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LWF Promoting Inter- Religious Tolerance and Culture of Peace  Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching goal of this project is to promote religious tolerance and culture of peace in the districts of Begi and Kondala of Western Ethiopia. Religious communities have lived side by side peacefully for years. This peaceful co-existence has deteriorated and violent conflict erupted among various religious groups, mainly between Christians and Muslims.</narrative>
  </description>
